PySide6 provides Python bindings for the Qt framework. It is used as a runtime
dependency and is dynamically linked. Users may replace PySide6 with any
compatible version under the terms of the LGPL v3. This covers PySide6-Essentials,
which the core SDK depends on. Qt Quick 3D, used by the optional "scene" extra, is
not available under the LGPL; see its entry below.

