License: GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0), or a commercial Qt license.
         Not available under the LGPL.
Homepage: https://doc.qt.io/qt-6/qtquick3d-index.html
Installed by: pip install "qtm-rt-pyside6[scene]" (from PySide6-Addons)

The 3D scene helpers (qtm_rt_pyside6.scene.quick3d and the Qualisys.Scene QML
view and layers) render with Qt Quick 3D. This SDK does not include or
distribute Qt Quick 3D: pip installs it as part of PySide6-Addons. A distributed
application that uses these helpers must comply with the GPL v3, for example by
releasing its source under the GPL v3, unless its author holds a commercial Qt
license. The core SDK and the qtm_rt_pyside6.scene data layer do not use Qt
Quick 3D.

